# Placeholder that keeps this directory alive in Git and in source archives.
#
# cmake/CheckTrezor.cmake generates the Trezor protobuf sources into this
# directory at configure time, and protoc does not create its output directory.
# Git stores no empty directories, and .gitattributes marks .git* export-ignore,
# so the .gitignore beside this file cannot keep the directory in an archive.
# This file, whose name matches no export-ignore pattern, does.
